  ('f163660f-52a5-5c68-8ac8-b2cce7ad3fe4', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-informative-writing'), null, 'easy',
   $q$Which sentence would best replace sentence 14 as the conclusion of the report?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Because light pollution hides the stars and disrupts wildlife, Pell Harbor's results suggest that simple lighting changes can bring meaningful benefits.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Pell Harbor replaced exactly 1,800 streetlights with shielded fixtures.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"restates-detail"},{"text":"Light pollution is extremely bad and it really needs to stop now.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"informal-overstatement"},{"text":"Air pollution from cars and factories is another serious problem in many cities.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"introduces-new-topic"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Because light pollution hides the stars and disrupts wildlife, Pell Harbor's results suggest that simple lighting changes can bring meaningful benefits.$q$, $q$The correct sentence connects the problems in paragraphs 1 to 3 with the solution in paragraph 4 and states its significance. Repeating the number of streetlights restates a detail without concluding.$q$, 'draft', 'e7e3a0fd-c9e7-5cfa-ab5e-8d45f6968b80')
